# Top-down market data archive (Ken French / AQR / Shiller) — same policy.
market/data/raw/
market/data/latest/

# Agency PDFs — non-blocking convenience mirror; gitignored per design.
pdfs/

# Adversarial-review output. Committed feedback fed Codex its own prior output
# on the next round, compounding token burn (fixed fleet-wide 2026-07-20 — this
# repo was one of 8 the fix never reached, and had accrued 1.9MB untracked).
codex_feedback/

